"Shown as the \"From\" name on every Learnomy email. Leave blank to use your "
"site title."
msgstr ""
"Wird als \"Von\"-Name in jeder Learnomy-E-Mail angezeigt. Lasse leer, um "
"deinen Website-Titel zu verwenden."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1975
msgid "Sender Email"
msgstr "Absender-E-Mail"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1982
msgid ""
"The \"From\" address on every Learnomy email. Leave blank to use your site "
"admin email."
msgstr ""
"Die \"Von\"-Adresse in jeder Learnomy-E-Mail. Lasse leer, um deine "
"Website-Admin-E-Mail zu verwenden."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1986
msgid "Test delivery"
msgstr "Lieferung testen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1992
msgid ""
"Sends a sample email to your account address so you can confirm delivery "
"and the sender identity above."
msgstr ""
"Sendet eine Beispiel-E-Mail an deine Kontoadresse, damit du die Lieferung "
"und die Absenderidentität oben bestätigen kannst."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:2000
